{"shortDescription":"By Ateeq ShariffGulf stocks ended mixed on Wednesday as an attack on a refinery in top crude exporter Saudi Arabia rattled investors and renewed concerns that conflict in the Middle East could escalate.Yemen's Iran-aligned Houthis said on Tuesday they had struck the 550,000-barrel-per-day facility…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["By Ateeq Shariff"]},{"type":"p","children":["Gulf stocks ended mixed on Wednesday as an attack on a refinery in top crude exporter Saudi Arabia rattled investors and renewed concerns that conflict in the Middle East could escalate."]},{"type":"p","children":["Yemen's Iran-aligned Houthis said on Tuesday they had struck the 550,000-barrel-per-day facility, the kingdom's biggest refinery, with a ballistic missile. Saudi authorities have not immediately confirmed the strike."]},{"type":"p","children":["Saudi Arabia's benchmark stock index ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TADAWUL:TASI","text":"TADAWUL:TASI"}}," reversed early losses to finish 0.4% higher, helped by a 0.7% increase in the country's biggest lender Saudi National Bank ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TADAWUL:1180","text":"TADAWUL:1180"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["National Shipping Company of Saudi Arabia ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TADAWUL:4030","text":"TADAWUL:4030"}}," advanced 1.6% after reporting a steep rise in quarterly profit."]},{"type":"p","children":["However, Mobile Telecommunications Company Saudi Arabia ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TADAWUL:7030","text":"TADAWUL:7030"}}," retreated 1.5% after a drop in third-quarter profit."]},{"type":"p","children":["Oil major Saudi Aramco ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TADAWUL:2222","text":"TADAWUL:2222"}}," was down 0.3%."]},{"type":"p","children":["Brent crude futures ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ICEEUR:BRN1!","text":"ICEEUR:BRN1!"}}," rose $1.31, or 1.2%, to $115.19 a barrel as of 1115 GMT, underpinned by renewed conc